  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3001.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3001.01 Purpose. As required by 40 CFR 51, Subpart U - Economic Incentive Programs, and by RSA 125-J, the purpose of this chapter is to ensure that any emissions reductions greater than required by the Act from the following source types shall be used, to the greatest extent possible, for economic development in New Hampshire:\n\n(1) Mobile sources;\n\n(2) Stationary sources;\n\n(3) Area sources; or\n\n(4) Off-road sources.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3000.html"
